OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPlenty of
OL,6,Fevening sunshine on offer this
OL,7,Fevening, leading to a dry and mostly
OL,8,Fclear night. Under clear skies
OL,9,Ftemperatures will be allow to fall
OL,10,Faway, with a rural frost possible.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FAnother dry and fairly sunny
OL,13,Fday for many, although increasing
OL,14,Fcloud in the east may bring some
OL,15,Fpatchy rain here heading into the
OL,16,Fevening. Temperatures near average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
