OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FOrganised showers move westwards
OL,7,Facross the region through Monday,
OL,8,Fclearing later. A dry interlude
OL,9,Ffollows, before more rain develops on
OL,10,FTuesday and Wednesday. Temperatures
OL,11,Fnearer average, though possibly windy
OL,12,Flater.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
